  "_note": "Page 2 (Minimum Plan Check Submittal Checklist) is a staff document-completeness checklist, not applicant data at all - entirely unmapped. 'Is this application the result of a Code Violation?' radio left unmapped (not guessed, same caution as Pomona's judgment-call Yes/No questions, even though 'No' is highly likely). 'Is this permit being pulled as Owner/Builder? YES/NO' - NO is mapped (we always pull as contractor, never owner-builder); YES stays unmapped. Duplicate City Business License#/Contact company/Contact License# fields in the Applicant block are redundant with the Contractor block above and left unmapped rather than reusing the same schema key twice.",
